<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0">Northwind Apparel approved your return for order #NW-1042.</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="k-bg" style="background:#f7f8fa">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 16px">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:560px">
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
<td class="k-mark" width="28" height="28" align="center" style="width:28px;height:28px;background:#2b59ff;color:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:28px">H</td>
<td class="k-fg" style="padding-left:10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#0b0d12">Hullwise</td>
</tr></table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="k-card" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e4e7ec;border-radius:8px;padding:24px">
<p class="k-fg" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#0b0d12">Hello Giulia,</p>
<p class="k-fg" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#0b0d12">Northwind Apparel approved your return R-1042 for order #NW-1042.</p>
<p class="k-fg" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#0b0d12">Your prepaid return label is ready: print it and stick it on the parcel.</p>
<blockquote class="k-quote" style="margin:0 0 16px;padding:8px 12px;border-left:3px solid #8391a8;color:#0b0d12;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5">Ship to: Returns, Via Roma 1, Milano.
Write R-1042 on the box.</blockquote>
<ul class="k-fg" style="margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:20px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#0b0d12"><li>Linen shirt · M × 1</li><li>Canvas sneaker · 40 × 2</li></ul>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:16px 0"><tr><td class="k-btn" style="background:#2b59ff;border-radius:8px"><a class="k-btn" href="https://app.hullwise.example/r/northwind-apparel/label/1?sig=abc" style="display:inline-block;padding:11px 18px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px">Download the return label</a></td></tr></table>
<p class="k-muted" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#5b6170">If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:<br><a class="k-link" href="https://app.hullwise.example/r/northwind-apparel/label/1?sig=abc" style="color:#2b59ff;word-break:break-all">https://app.hullwise.example/r/northwind-apparel/label/1?sig=abc</a></p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="k-muted" style="padding:16px 4px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#5b6170">
You receive this email about a return you requested from Northwind Apparel.<br>Questions? Write to support@hullwise.example.<br>Hullwise Labs S.r.l. · Via Example 1, 20100 Milano<br><a class="k-link" href="https://app.hullwise.example/u/signed" style="color:#5b6170">Unsubscribe from these emails</a>
</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>",
