  "text": "You now have access to Northwind Apparel on Hullwise. A few things to start with:

- Complete your profile: photo, language, time zone and security notices. https://app.hullwise.example/t/northwind-apparel/profile
- Connect your store and ad accounts with the integration guide. https://app.hullwise.example/t/northwind-apparel/integrations/guide/shopify

